msgid ""
"No new bells and whistles, just incremental improvements to bring you a faster"
", more stable app. All that glitters is not gold — sometimes it's code!"
msgstr ""

#. translators: This is a standard chunk of text used to tell a user what's new with a release when nothing major has changed.
